      "value": "I can confirm this occurs with avatars as well. I thought at first this was a problem with buffer particle setups and constraints. But they were supposedly recently fixed. I was about to make a canny myself until I saw this one and tested it out. It does appear to be related to the shape module. \n\nExample avatar I observed this problem with: \n\n**avtr_1698ecd3-c00c-4eec-a2c6-240d945650f4** \n\n(Use right fist gesture to shoot, left first to reload)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
