      "value": "Recent patchnotes for build 1371 claim this is fixed. This still occurs with avatars however from my testing. \n\nUsed same example avatar from previous comment: \n\n**avtr_1698ecd3-c00c-4eec-a2c6-240d945650f4**\n\n \n\n(Use right fist gesture to shoot, left first to reload)",
